# ReasonML: Reason documentation (reasonml.github.io): syntax cheatsheet, strings; requirements/languages/reason.md
name     reason re rei reasonml

keyword  let rec type module open include if else switch fun try exception external mutable and as
keyword  assert lazy for while in to downto when of
type     int float string bool unit array list option char
builtin  true false None Some Ok Error

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   {| |}  : multiline
string   " "    : escapes
escape        : x=2
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
upper-type
calls
hook     apostrophe
